Package: com.music27.tweak
Name: Music27
Version: 1.1.38
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Restyle Apple Music on iOS 16/17 toward the iOS 26/27 Liquid Glass look. 1.1.38: the pill now shows the last song you played, paused, instead of vanishing; tapping it no longer toggles an off-screen shuffle control; the album download button mirrors Music’s own download state; and the stock buttons stop flashing before they are hidden.
Maintainer: Music27
Author: Music27
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader
